<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92605" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόδον</span></b> , τό, metaplast.
		dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδέεσσι</span>
		v.l. in
		<i><span class="en">
			A.R.
			3.1020
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rose</i>,
			first in <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Cer.</u>
				6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				537
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				4(3).18(36)
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.289
			</span></i>; 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρόδον</span></b>  (q.v.); mostly of
				<i>Rosa gallica, red rose</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.6.4
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἑκατοντάφυλλον</span>,
				<i>Rosa centifolia, cabbage rose</i>, ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥ. ἄγριον</span>, <i>Rosa dumetorum, wild
				rose</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.2.1
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόδα μ᾽
			εἴρηκας</span> you've spoken <i>roses</i> of me, have said
				<i>all things sweet and</i>
			<i>beautiful</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				910
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάττε πολλοῖς τοῖς
			ῥόδοις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				1330
			</span></i>: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς διὰ ῥόδων</span> 'a
			bull in a china shop', <i><span class="en">
				Crates Com.
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδωνιά</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Coluth.
				348
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ῥόδα</span></b> , τά,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοδισμός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Rev.Hist.Rel.</u>
				97.275
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Bulgaria</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>pudenda muliebria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				108.29
			</span></i>.</div>
